      "type": "session_summary",
      "summary": "Shipped wishlist #69, Handoff Completeness as a First-Class Policy: protected must-survive (high/critical risk_level) decisions at both loss points in packet_builder.py (_select_decisions cap, _trim_to_budget removal loop), added a _check_completeness regression safety net wired into audit trail + a 6th Needs Attention source, and redesigned Drift-Bench's handoff scenario pair now that the original gap is closed. This closed the entire Safety Infrastructure Hardening queue's remaining low-hanging-fruit item from the reviewer batch. Full suite: 2026 passing (was 1992). Live-verified against real tropelex project after restarting a stale dev server process. Committed and pushed (6ad0fe2).",
      "insights": [
        "Session involved backend: server",
        "Session involved architecture: structure, design"
      ],
      "day": "monday"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-11T02:47:44.071246+00:00",
      "type": "session_summary",
      "summary": "Picked wishlist #67, Semantic Intent Layer for Ghost Preventive Checks, and built the infra: extracted a shared get_decision_embeddings cache (core/embeddings.py, now serving both Contradiction Detection and Ghost), plus an opt-in embedding-aware rescue path in match_decision_to_diff/check_diff_for_warnings with a hard severity cap. A required dry-run against real tropelex decisions found the approach can't be safely thresholded (target case scores 0.29 cosine similarity, an unrelated typo fix scores up to 0.65 on shared vocabulary alone) -- would have repeated #57's own prior incident if wired live. User chose to keep the tested infra but not wire it into the live gate; reverted the router/Drift-Bench live wiring accordingly, added a defensive error-handling fix to the shared cache along the way. Full suite: 2051 passing (was 2026). Committed and pushed (6e61ea0).",
      "insights": [
        "Session involved backend: route",
        "Session involved bug: fix, error",
        "Session involved performance: cache"
      ],
      "day": "tuesday"
    },
    {
