    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-13T04:57:45.967290+00:00",
      "type": "session_summary",
      "summary": "- Cross-project data bleed \u2014 fixed \n- Added repo_path tracking + fallback labeling. \n- Fixed several dashboard panels (Narrative, Why Do We, Git) showing stale results. \n- Wired last30days into real cost tracking.\n= Re-Anchoring in Context Bundles (#44) \u2014 active goals now surface in context bundles and handoff packets.\n- Fixed Add Decision form's goal-link dropdown only showing active-status goals.\n- Draft Policy Schema for Gates (#64) \u2014 the enforcement policy for Ghost's block/warn/log gate had no validation or write endpoint; added a real schema + GET/PUT /gate-policy.\n- Fixed the Add Decision form dead-ending with an unreadable \"[object Object]\" error on high-risk decisions \n- Error-handling audit - found and fixed 3 real gaps (missing fail-open handling on the new contradiction gate, a type-safety hole in repo-path resolution, an unguarded malformed-data path in the goal-scoped leaderboard).\n- Goals reconciliation: audited all 24 tracked goals against actual shipped work.",
      "insights": [
        "Session involved backend: endpoint",
        "Session involved bug: fix, error"
      ],
      "day": "thursday"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-13T21:35:50.579160+00:00",
      "type": "session_summary",
      "summary": "Summary of this turn:\n1. #19 shipped \u2014 Session Replay with AI Analysis, scoped to 2 of the original 5 bullets (auto-summarize + retrospectives; the other 3 either duplicate existing detectors or risk generating ungrounded advice, disclosed in the wishlist). New core/session_insights.py, two new endpoints, a route-ordering bug caught and fixed mid-build, dashboard UI panel, live-verified against real session history.\n2. \"Show\" buttons in Time Travel \u2014 restyled from plain underlined text links to colored pill buttons, verified in the browser.\n3. #43 \u2014 Coordination Drift Detection is shipped\n4. Decision to work on organism metaphor",
      "insights": [
        "Session involved ui: style",
        "Session involved backend: endpoint, route",
        "Session involved bug: fix"
      ],
      "day": "thursday"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-16T14:36:21.254919+00:00",
      "type": "session_summary",
      "summary": "P0 \u2014 Persona/market escalation moved off the GET /reviews/pending read path onto an explicit POST /reviews/escalate-persona-market + a 6h scheduler task, both now writing an auditable persona_market_escalated event.\n\nP1 \u2014 Instance shared-secret auth + Host validation. TROPEL_EX_SECRET auto-generates into .env; a Host-header check blocks DNS-rebinding-style spoofing; every mutating /api/ call now requires the secret unless the browser's own Sec-Fetch-Site header proves it's a genuine same-origin request (so the dashboard needed zero changes). Wired the token into the MCP server, OpenCode plugin, VS Code extension, and Emacs package.\n\nP2 \u2014 Decision-level tamper-evidence. Every decision now carries a content hash, recomputed on every legitimate mutation (tag, review, rollback, and all three escalation paths).",
      "insights": [
