      "hash": "13e8174f52b0653dbaadf3d7537fb4013c064bdba0747aa57246b1495dbb7ffa"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "handoff_created",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-10T23:55:19.072398+00:00",
      "previous_hash": "13e8174f52b0653dbaadf3d7537fb4013c064bdba0747aa57246b1495dbb7ffa",
      "role": "TestEngineer",
      "agent_name": "unspecified",
      "packet_hash": "e1e876d3b56edd45dc0ca4070922abb1f829e91816241c3712bb6041a8f9230e",
      "hash": "85da90d1d5e74e2dc9000d811b4538b89933c4f1d0e63d166e2cc6dbe4d733a2"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "decision_created",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-11T00:56:31.000447+00:00",
      "previous_hash": "85da90d1d5e74e2dc9000d811b4538b89933c4f1d0e63d166e2cc6dbe4d733a2",
      "decision_id": "703789ca820a",
      "decision": "Doc Mining \u2014 Scans every markdown file in the repo for drift against recorded decisions, contradictions between docs, and decision-shaped claims never captured in the decision graph. Reuses the Contradiction Detection engine rather than a separate one",
      "risk_level": "low",
      "hash": "9a9bfadd062d8273a3f474a3971e93128808ff17abe9d5667222be6bdb35b735"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "decision_created",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-11T00:56:43.286308+00:00",
      "previous_hash": "9a9bfadd062d8273a3f474a3971e93128808ff17abe9d5667222be6bdb35b735",
      "decision_id": "842788da1899",
      "decision": "Mines session transcripts for implicit friction signals (corrections, rephrasing, retry loops, rapid edits) that never got explicitly logged as decisions.",
      "risk_level": "low",
      "hash": "cccacd13682a97c19e7b6eff94da360344be46c75bee68abb339045b511f5d2f"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "decision_created",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-11T00:57:15.807689+00:00",
      "previous_hash": "cccacd13682a97c19e7b6eff94da360344be46c75bee68abb339045b511f5d2f",
      "decision_id": "32c97391e57b",
      "decision": "Strips filler and normalizes prompt content before it reaches the model: using an LLM pass when a key is configured, or deterministic dictionary rules otherwise.",
      "risk_level": "medium",
      "hash": "204d286fc6517ae8864bc81dc027f496a2bc3654fbe65311be9cc53f9efb9793"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "decision_created",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-11T00:57:31.166545+00:00",
      "previous_hash": "204d286fc6517ae8864bc81dc027f496a2bc3654fbe65311be9cc53f9efb9793",
      "decision_id": "e0dab4539c84",
      "decision": "The brand personality is precise, efficient, and sophisticated, targeting power users who require data density without sacrificing clarity.",
      "risk_level": "low",
      "hash": "e3ae948865dc45c01867f4f2a23c5dce49e312a73ade9f5366c472d406eb306b"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "decision_created",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-11T00:57:37.188236+00:00",
      "previous_hash": "e3ae948865dc45c01867f4f2a23c5dce49e312a73ade9f5366c472d406eb306b",
      "decision_id": "e517b57bc58d",
      "decision": "The visual style is a fusion of Corporate Modern and Minimalism, using deep obsidian surfaces and vibrant electric accents to create a high-contrast, \"pro-tool\" environment.",
      "risk_level": "medium",
      "hash": "93ca686d79a178e09f90bcb7b639aaaf93f8fff96717fe73b312fe1981845aff"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "decision_created",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-11T00:57:40.432020+00:00",
      "previous_hash": "93ca686d79a178e09f90bcb7b639aaaf93f8fff96717fe73b312fe1981845aff",
      "decision_id": "2f40fd4c814f",
      "decision": "Transitions should be instantaneous and functional, reinforcing a sense of speed and reliability.",
      "risk_level": "low",
      "hash": "8b6b65d93de6b2a8da30dc1d517d5e349aa0469e437cc97481ae4b6a398d883b"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "decision_created",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-11T00:57:44.516967+00:00",
      "previous_hash": "8b6b65d93de6b2a8da30dc1d517d5e349aa0469e437cc97481ae4b6a398d883b",
      "decision_id": "0fed7f62d93c",
      "decision": "Functional Accents: Use low-chroma indigos and greys for secondary information, ensuring the electric purple remains the clear focal point for user interaction.",
      "risk_level": "low",
      "hash": "4fd4eb7f93f0aaee88d4293d0b14c226312a10aa9e6cfea894a2c142c65343cb"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "decision_created",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-11T00:58:39.736832+00:00",
      "previous_hash": "4fd4eb7f93f0aaee88d4293d0b14c226312a10aa9e6cfea894a2c142c65343cb",
      "decision_id": "04f11b1f0b22",
      "decision": "quote character doesn't corrupt the request -- requires jq on PATH):",
      "risk_level": "low",
      "hash": "2bd6d0ef108b1a44813b4626d321fc0b3bf800f72b3e22c92bfa787ab138f7d1"
    },
    {
      "event_type": "decision_created",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-11T00:59:04.088536+00:00",
      "previous_hash": "2bd6d0ef108b1a44813b4626d321fc0b3bf800f72b3e22c92bfa787ab138f7d1",
      "decision_id": "faba84e60375",
      "decision": "Citation-Grade Web Research: web-researcher-mcp (spoken to directly over MCP's stdio protocol, no extra Python dependency). Runs a small loop of search \u2192 LLM-refined follow-up query \u2192 search again, and imports every real, verifiable source URL straight into the Tropebook citation library. Requires the web-researcher-mcp binary on PATH.",
      "risk_level": "medium",
      "hash": "f6f33d14e52763ba76e9153b5cda523c4d0b6b8f159a05a8a74c6c07b6ded3eb"
    },
